    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>DM-only: This is the enormous wolf in the Q38 dreamlike vision. It keeps the established Q38 chase statistics, Huge size, and decisive Bite profile, with Barovian dire wolf senses and traits. It is immune to the charmed and frightened conditions. It has only the Bite attack; omit Tail and Multiattack. The vision ends after the attack roll and defensive reactions resolve, before damage or conditions are applied. The surrounding pack is visual and auditory only and does not count as an ally for Pack Tactics.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
