      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Melee Weapon Attack: +10 to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. Hit: 33 (4d12 + 7) piercing damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 13 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone. A Medium or smaller target is grappled (escape DC 17) and restrained while grappled. DM-only Q38 adaptation: resolve the attack and defensive reactions, then end the vision before applying damage or any conditions. This Foundry attack rolls to hit only.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
